<title>SPAIN: Issing - France Telecom deal not an example.</title>
<headline>Issing - France Telecom deal not an example.</headline>
<dateline>PAMPLONA, Spain 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank board member Otmar Issing said on Thursday the French Telecom deal should not serve as an example to fulfilling the criteria for participation in Europe's single currency launch.</p>
<p>&quot;That is not a case that should be taken as an example,&quot; Issing said.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
